Subject: [PATCH 2/3] dma: rcar-audmapp: don't keep audmapp_slave_config for each channeles
User-Agent: Wanderlust/2.14.0 Emacs/23.3 Mule/6.0
To: Vinod Koul <vinod.koul@intel.com>
